note bottom of OptimizationService
  Async flow: optimizeAsync registers JobHandle,
  solves via jsprit, then CallbackService notifies Entry API.
  Cancel/progress read live state from JobRegistry (in-memory, TTL 30m).
end note

note bottom of CostMatrix
  O(N*S) block-diagonal storage replaces dense O(n^2):
  pruned pairs return PRUNED_METERS/PRUNED_SECONDS sentinel,
  never throw (see CostMatrix.java contract).
end note

